  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aus4Innovation (Vietnam)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment is contributing to Vietnam&#x2019;s innovation system to support inclusive, sustainable socio-economic development. It is implemented by the Commonwealth Scientific and Industrial Research Organisation (CSIRO), with a focus on resilient agriculture and food. It has four end outcomes: (i) enhanced capacity for institutional, and policy and regulatory reform in targeted Ministries that enable inclusive innovation; (ii) improved ability of targeted innovation ecosystems in the selected sector to continuously respond to an evolving context; (iii) inclusive national and regional innovation support mechanisms connect people, ideas, investment and resources to respond to innovation opportunities and challenges; (iv) sustainable, mutually beneficial partnerships that strengthen Australian and Vietnamese Innovation Systems. The key partners of this investment are the Ministry of Science and Technology and several agencies under the Ministry of Agriculture and Rural Development.</narrative>
  </description>
